---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="国宝凪ノ城｜錦乃｜WORKS"
  description="Minecraft Java Editionで制作した創作和風城郭『凪ノ城』。和風町「鉄火」の象徴として築かれた壮大な創作城郭を紹介します。"
>

<!-- =========================================================
     HERO
========================================================= -->

<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <!-- Background -->

  <picture>

    <!-- Smartphone -->
    <source
      media="(max-width: 768px)"
      srcset="/images/naginocastle-mobile.jpg"
    />

    <!-- PC -->
    <img
      src="/images/nagino-2.png"
      alt="凪ノ城"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />

  </picture>


  <!-- Content -->

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <!-- English -->

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          NAGINO CASTLE
        </p>


        <!-- Title -->

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[48px] leading-[1.15] text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          国宝凪ノ城
        </h1>


        <!-- Subtitle -->

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#ffffff]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          東軍進軍の要にして巨大な島。
        </p>


        <!-- Gold Divider -->

        <div class="mt-1">

          <img
            src="/images/gold-divider.png"
            alt=""
            class="w-[420px] h-auto select-none pointer-events-none"
            draggable="false"
          />

        </div>


        <!-- Summary -->

        <div class="mt-14 max-w-2xl">
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>


  <!-- Scroll -->

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     INTRODUCTION
========================================================= -->

<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <!-- Washi Background -->

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />


  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">

    <!-- =====================================================
         OVERVIEW
    ====================================================== -->

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        作品概要
      </h2>


      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        凪ノ城は、Minecraft Java Editionにて制作した創作の和風城郭です。<br>
        建築RPGサーバー「波鯖」に存在する和風町「鉄火」の中心に築かれた、
        町を象徴する大型城郭作品です。
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl">
    </div>


    <!-- =====================================================
         INFORMATION
    ====================================================== -->

    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <!-- Left -->

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>


        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          凪ノ城について
        </h2>


        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

          凪ノ城（Nagino Castle）は、Minecraft Java Editionにて制作した創作の和風城郭です。

          建築RPGサーバー「波鯖」内に広がる和風町「鉄火」の管理を任された際、エリアを象徴する建造物として町の中心に普請されました。

          <br><br>

          かつて厄災によって滅びた旧和風町の島跡を埋め立て、のちにできた新島全体を惣構え式の城郭とするように築城。

          将軍家の命を受け、西方の武家勢力を陥落させ東軍の進軍を加速させるための軍事拠点として築かれたという歴史背景を持ちます。

          <br><br>

          形式は平山城。

          天守構造は独立式層塔型天守を採用しており、その高さは江戸城天守よりわずか2メートルほど低いという非常に壮大な規模を誇ります。

          <br><br>

          全体の外壁は赤や金、木の色をアクセントにした戦国城郭らしい木張りで仕上げ、比較的黒系の瓦を基調としています。

          さらに、青く彩られた大棟や、通常であれば鯱が据えられる位置に置かれた頭部が龍の「青龍」の装飾など、創作城郭ならではの幻想的で厳かなデザインが随所に光ります。

          <br><br>

          大坂城や名古屋城といった近世城郭が持つ重厚な佇まいをモチーフにしつつ、旧天守の意匠を受け継いだ新たな櫓群や門、石垣などを組み合わせて独自の世界観を表現しました。

          <br><br>

          初期に完成した天守のタイムラプス動画は、YouTube Shortsにて「マイクラで国宝級の城を建てました。」と題して投稿し、再生回数80万回を超える大きな反響を呼びました。

          <br><br>

          その後、城全体の規模拡張にともなって全面的な再設計が行われ、より壮麗な「第二次天守」へと建て替えられています。

          初期天守から姿を変えつつも、凪ノ城は今なお和風町鉄火の発展を静かに見守り続けています。

        </p>

      </div>


      <!-- DATA -->

      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>


          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品名</p>
              <p class="text-base">凪ノ城</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">分類</p>
              <p class="text-base">和風城郭</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">建築年代</p>
              <p class="text-base">2025年5月〜6月</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">所在地</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                建築RPGサーバー波鯖新和風町鉄火凪ノ町本丸一丁目１番
              </p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">築城年</p>
              <p class="text-base">慶長5年（1600年）</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">築城主</p>
              <p class="text-base">錦乃</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">形式</p>
              <p class="text-base">平山城</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作ソフト</p>
              <p class="text-base">Minecraft: Java Edition v1.21.4</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品区分</p>
              <p class="text-base">和風建築・創作</p>
            </div>


            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作状況</p>
              <p class="text-base">完成</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>


    <!-- =====================================================
         GALLERY
    ====================================================== -->

    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        展示写真
      </h2>


      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino-2.png"
            alt="凪ノ城"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino-0.png"
            alt="凪ノ城"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino.jpg"
            alt="凪ノ城"
          />
        </div>


        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/nagino-3.png"
            alt="凪ノ城"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>


    <!-- =====================================================
         BACK / LINKS
    ====================================================== -->

    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

      <a
        href="/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 作品一覧へ戻る
      </a>


      <a
        href="/edocastle/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        次へ進む →
      </a>


      <a
        href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/7Zi19slunLM"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        もっと動画を見る →
      </a>

    </div>


    <!-- =====================================================
         SHARE
    ====================================================== -->

    <div class="mt-32 text-center">

      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          SHARE
        </p>

        <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

      </div>


      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        作品をシェア
      </h2>


      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

        <!-- X -->

        <a
          href="https://x.com/intent/post?text=%E9%8C%A6%E4%B9%83%E3%80%8C%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%9D%E5%87%AA%E3%83%8E%E5%9F%8E%E3%80%8D%20%7C%20WORKS&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nishikinolab.net%2Fnaginocastle%2F"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          X
        </a>


        <!-- Instagram -->

        <button
          type="button"
          id="instagram-share"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          Instagram
        </button>


        <!-- Copy -->

        <button
          type="button"
          id="copy-url"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          URLをコピー
        </button>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>


<!-- =========================================================
     SHARE SCRIPT
========================================================= -->

<script>

  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/naginocastle/";


  const copyButton =
    document.getElementById("copy-url");


  const instagramButton =
    document.getElementById("instagram-share");


  /* =========================================================
     COPY URL
  ========================================================== */

  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

    try {

      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {

        copyButton.textContent = "コピーしました";

        setTimeout(() => {

          copyButton.textContent = "URLをコピー";

        }, 2000);

      }

    } catch (error) {

      console.error(error);

    }

  });


  /* =========================================================
     INSTAGRAM SHARE
  ========================================================== */

  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog =
      document.createElement("div");


    dialog.innerHTML = `

      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >

        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>


          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            Instagramでシェア
          </h3>


          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            この作品ページのURLをコピーして<br>
            Instagramを開きます。
          </p>


          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            URLをコピーしてInstagramを開く
          </button>


          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            キャンセル
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    `;


    document.body.appendChild(dialog);


    const overlay =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-share-overlay"
      );


    const openButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-open"
      );


    const cancelButton =
      document.getElementById(
        "instagram-cancel"
      );


    openButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      async () => {

        try {

          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(
            pageUrl
          );

        } catch (error) {

          console.error(error);

        }


        window.open(
          "https://www.instagram.com/",
          "_blank",
          "noopener,noreferrer"
        );


        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    cancelButton?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      () => {

        overlay?.remove();

      }
    );


    overlay?.addEventListener(
      "click",
      (event) => {

        if (event.target === overlay) {

          overlay.remove();

        }

      }
    );

  });

</script>


<!-- =========================================================
     STYLE
========================================================= -->

<style>

.work-hero {

  animation:
    heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;

  transform-origin:
    center;

}


@keyframes heroFloat {

  0% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

  50% {

    transform:
      scale(1.06)
      translateY(-18px);

  }

  100% {

    transform:
      scale(1.03)
      translateY(0);

  }

}


section {

  position:
    relative;

}


section::before {

  content:
    "";

  position:
    absolute;

  left:
    0;

  top:
    0;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    100%;

  pointer-events:
    none;

  background-image:

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 8% 10%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.08),
      transparent 18%
    ),

    radial-gradient(
      circle at 92% 82%,
      rgba(205,175,98,.06),
      transparent 22%
    );

}


aside {

  position:
    sticky;

  top:
    120px;

  height:
    max-content;

}


a {

  transition:
    .35s;

}


/* =========================================================
   GALLERY GRADIENT FRAME
   江戸城完成形と同じ写真ごとのグラデーション縁取り
========================================================= */


.gallery-frame {

  position:
    relative;

  padding:
    2px;

  border-radius:
    1.25rem;

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow:
    hidden;

}


.gallery-frame img {

  display:
    block;

  width:
    100%;

  height:
    auto;

  border-radius:
    calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background:
    #f8f6f2;

}


.gallery-frame:hover {

  background:

    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

}


@media (max-width:1100px) {

  section {

    overflow:
      hidden;

  }

}



@media (max-width:768px) {

  section:first-child {

    height:
      760px;

  }


  .gallery-frame {

    border-radius:
      1rem;

  }


  .gallery-frame img {

    border-radius:
      calc(1rem - 2px);

  }

}

</style>

</Layout>